고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">,</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">집체교육</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">4.</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">모집인원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">:<b> 24</b></span><b><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">명</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">(선착순 모집)</span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">5.</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">모집기간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">: 2025년 12월 16일(화) ~&nbsp; 22</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">일</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">(월</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">) 18</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">시 / 12월 23일(화) 발표 예정</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">6.</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">신청자격</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">:</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">본교 재학생 <b>3~4학년</b></span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;<u>(</u></span></span><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">4</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">학년 우선선발 / 1~3차 기참여자는 후순위, 기존 인원 미달시 선발 예정)</span></u></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 51.8pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -51.8pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">7.</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">신청방법</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">:</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">국립금오공과대학교 학생역량관리시스템</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">(BISkit)</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">비교과프로그램을 통해 신청</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 51.8pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -51.8pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">8.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -67.4pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">교육내용</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -67.4pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">(</span><span style=\"text-indent: -67.4pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">안</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -67.4pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 67.4pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -67.4pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">-&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12pt;\">클린룸(청정실) 청정도 등급 이해, 출입시 준수사항 및 안전관리 숙지</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 67.4pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8; word-break: break-all; text-indent: -67.4pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; text-indent: -89.8667px;\"><font color=\"#212121\">- 반도체 Fab. 공정 실습을 통한&nbsp;</font></span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; text-indent: -67.4pt;\">실제 장비운용 원리·방법 이해</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 68.7pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -68.7pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">※</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">교육내용은 변경될 수 있습니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">[</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">유의사항</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">]</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, 돋움, Dotum, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><b>-<u><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">프로그램 취소시기 이후&nbsp;개인사정 등으로 불참시, 추후 RISE사업단 반도체 부트캠프 참여 제한</span></u></b></span></span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">-서울에서 5일간 진행되는 교육으로 <b>5일간 숙박과 교육 모두</b> 가능한 학생</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><strong style=\"font-weight: bold; line-height: 1; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, 돋움, Dotum, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;\"></strong></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">-식사 및 숙박 제공<b>(참여비용 없음)</b>,&nbsp;<b>Biskit 마일리지</b> 제공&nbsp;및 <b>수료증 </b>발</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">급</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">-집결 및 집합 시간 준수</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">-캠프&nbsp;중 개인 이동 및 개인 숙박 불가(안내자의 안내에 따를 것)</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">-안전을 위해 편안한 복장(바지) 및 운동화 착용 권장, FAB 공정 실습 교육시 화장 불가(캡모자 등 모자 지참 선택)</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: b